# Financial Reporting & Corporate Analysis Evaluation

### Overview
This project establishes an evaluation framework to assess AI model accuracy and reasoning in financial statement analysis, balance sheet interpretation, income statement metrics, and corporate financial reporting.

### Key Components
* **Financial Metric Auditing:** Evaluated AI-generated calculations of key financial ratios (liquidity, profitability, leverage, and efficiency).
* **Corporate Reporting Standards:** Assessed compliance, clarity, and depth in explaining financial statements and executive summaries.
* **Business Scenario Analysis:** Tested model reasoning and logical consistency on corporate finance case studies and variance analysis.
